<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-167.1-screening-program-strategy-policy-and-governance" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4865" name="W4865. Workforce Vetting &amp; Background-Screening Program Strategy &amp; Operating Model" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program launch; annual HR/security strategy review; major insider-risk event; regulatory change
Frequency: Annual + on trigger
Volume: 1 group program; ~6,918 employees + contingent + vendor personnel + executives
Owner: CHRO / Chief Compliance &amp; Security Officer / Screening Program Manager
Participants: HR (VS-19/121), Security (VS-159), LP (VS-23), Legal (VS-100.3), Privacy (VS-91), Contingent Workforce (VS-98)
Source: workflow W4865 — Workforce Vetting &amp; Background-Screening Program Strategy &amp; Operating Model</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4865_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4865_Lane1" name="Screening Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4865_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4865_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4865_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4865_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4865_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4865_Start3" name="Program launch; annual HR/security strategy review; major insider-risk event; regulatory…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4865_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4865_Task4" name="Set the program strategy &amp; operating model: the screening scope (employees…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set the program strategy &amp; operating model: the screening scope (employees, contingent, vendor/3PL personnel, executives), the centralized screening function (shared service) with role-based packages, make-vs-buy (screening vendor W4867), and integration with recruiting (VS-121), contingent (VS-98), security (VS-159), and LP (VS-23)
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / HR / Security
Accountable (A): CHRO / Chief Compliance &amp; Security Officer
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4865_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4865_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4865_Task5" name="Define the risk-based screening taxonomy: role risk tiers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Define the risk-based screening taxonomy: role risk tiers (cash-handling/finance, security/CIT, IT-admin/data, child-adjacent, forklift/driver safety-sensitive, executive) mapped to screening-package depth; align to negligent-hiring liability, DOLE OSH, and fair-chance principles
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / Security / Legal / HR
Accountable (A): CHRO / Chief Compliance &amp; Security Officer
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4865_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4865_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4865_Task6" name="Approve the strategy, resource the function, integrate into ERM (VS-21.2) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Approve the strategy, resource the function, integrate into ERM (VS-21.2) and the insider-risk program (VS-23/VS-159), and set KPIs (screening coverage %, TAT, hit-rate, adverse-action %, re-screening currency, insider events linked to screening gaps); report to the board/audit &amp; risk committee (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Screening Program Manager / Risk / Strategy
Accountable (A): CHRO / Chief Compliance &amp; Security Officer / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4865_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4865_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4865_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4865_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4865_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-731 (ensure controlled execution — Screening Program Strategy, Policy &amp; Governance (PA-167.1).) | - CTL-731: centralized screening function; role-risk taxonomy; board-reported KPIs
Owner: CHRO / Chief Compliance &amp; Security Officer / Screening Program Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4865_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4865_Annotation8" targetRef="W4865_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4865_Flow10" sourceRef="W4865_Start3" targetRef="W4865_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4865_Flow11" sourceRef="W4865_Task4" targetRef="W4865_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4865_Flow12" sourceRef="W4865_Task5" targetRef="W4865_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4865_Flow13" sourceRef="W4865_Task6" targetRef="W4865_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W4865_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W4865_plane" bpmnElement="W_W4865">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W4865_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W4865_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
