        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-131 (ensure lawful &amp; consented personnel vetting.) | - CTL-731: SoD between screen/decide/hire; individualized assessment; appeal path; NLRC-aligned
Owner: Screening Program Manager / Adverse-Action Review Board / Legal (VS-100.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
